From 4673764bad49c0d4b17a19e69027ef393235e662 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 17:14:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] R08 r13: abstention + limited explanation in classify();
 leave-family-out protocol

- abstain.py: multi_topic / latin_script / low_margin (M=0.25 chosen on round-12 validation)
  / no_content; explanation = matched stems + top word-prefix contributions vs runner-up.
- classify(): contract fields unchanged; on abstain score=None, score_kind=abstain:<reasons>;
  additive fields abstain, abstain_reasons, alternatives, explanation, policy_version.
- protocol.py: 5-fold leave-family-out CV (56 origin groups) for keyword/logreg/hybrid/nb/
  hybrid+abstain with round-12 hyperparameters (no tuning); exploratory test/probe.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CcnxZPmJeLbSLt4S9JZCrb
